        976
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "d. Integrated Financial System and Standard Fiscal Manual. The Director shall develop a centralized, web-based system to facilitate the financial relationship between CCS Agencies and CCS providers, including contract budget setting, budget modifications, invoicing, and payment. In collaboration with the CCS Agencies and the Office of Management and Budget (OMB), the Director shall also develop and maintain a Standard Fiscal Manual for the provision of Client and Community Services to standardize financial budget formats, claiming and billing procedures, and administrative overhead rates to the maximum feasible extent, so as to improve efficiency for both CCS Agencies and CCS Providers.",
